 `CanonError::Lowering` and `CanonError::SourceInconsistent`; `purrdf_rdf::gts_certify::CertifyError::CanonMismatch`;
 `purrdf_rdf::gts_certify::CertificateCborError::UnknownCanon` and `UnexpectedCanon`.
 
